\nPrice On Request\n\n![Chaitanya Radha Madhav residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/chaitanya-radha-madhav-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.22 Cr to 1.90 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Nicco Vanashri Heights\n\n### What unit types and sizes are on offer?\n\nThe project includes 2 BHK units (732 and 750 sq ft carpet) and 3 BHK units (1,036–1,591 sq ft). Spacious designs cater to families and shared living needs.\n\n### Is the project RERA registered and when is possession?\n\nYes, this project is under RERA ID P51800077982. Possession by December 2028 according to builder and agent sources.\n\n### What amenities are made available on-site?\n\nProvides wide range of options: gym, pool, tennis/badminton courts, football field, indoor games, library, mini-theatre, dance room, in addition to jogging track, gazebo, observatory deck, etc.\n\n### How is connectivity?\n\nThe project has excellent transit with just 250 m to Borivali station and near bus depot, police station, schools and retail centers.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/projects-new-homes/borivali-west","title":"New Projects in Borivali West - Mumbai Property Exchange","raw_content":"[![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)](/)\n[List Property](/list-property)[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919820067525)\n\n[New Projects](/projects-new-homes)[🗺️ Projects Map](/projects-map)[Buy a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/sale/all-locations)[Rent a Flat](/apartments-flats-house/rent/all-locations)[Commercial](/commercial-office-premises/s